= 银行业危机

The Darmstädter und Nationalbank, or Danat Bank, has collapsed! Along with it goes much of the German banking system. The cause seemed to be due to the government's pursuit of a customs union with Austria, which led to de facto international sanctions.

This is a bourgeois dispute, but the costs will be borne by the proletariat. The people are facing ever-increasing hunger and poverty, and perhaps we are partly to blame.

- @nothing_to_do: 我们无能为力。
- @stabilization: 采取行动稳定经济!
- @austerity: [+ chancellor +] 总理的应对一如既往:更多紧缩。
- @end_toleration: 我们受够了紧缩。终结容忍安排!

@nothing_to_do
view-if: spd_in_government = 1
on-arrival: welfare -= 1; workers_spd -= 3; unemployed_spd -= 3; pro_republic -= 3

There is, essentially, nothing we can do.

@stabilization
view-if: spd_in_government = 1
subtitle: -1 财政预算
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 2; inflation += 1 if inflation < 0; budget -= 1; workers_nsdap -= 3; economic_growth += 0.9;

In the face of the banking crisis, we have taken emergency action to stabilize the economy by injecting money into the banking system. It might not be enough, but it temporarily staunches the bleeding.

@austerity
view-if: spd_in_government = 0
on-arrival: welfare -= 1; workers_spd -= 2 if spd_toleration; unemployed_spd -= 3 if spd_toleration; left_dissent += 10 if spd_toleration; workers_spd += 3 if not spd_toleration; unemployed_spd += 3 if not spd_toleration; pro_republic -= 3; economic_growth -= 1;

Chancellor [+ chancellor +] responds to the banking crisis with more cuts to welfare.

@end_toleration
view-if: spd_toleration = 1
on-arrival: time_to_election = 3; spd_in_government = 0; in_grand_coalition = 0; spd_toleration = 0; weimar_dissent += 1 if weimar_plan_adopted
call: set_next_election_time

We are tired of [+ chancellor +]'s policy of austerity. After [+ chancellor +]'s attempt to use emergency powers to pass another welfare cut, we have worked with the other parties to reverse this policy. In response, the Reichstag has been dissolved, and new elections called.

新的选举已定于 [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]。
